{
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Act 5: The Terror",
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "s06b01",
     "shot": "robespierre_host",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "His name was Maximilien Robespierre, and here's the twist.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b02",
     "shot": "speech_1791",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In 1791 he had given speeches arguing that France should abolish the death penalty.",
     "date": 1791,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:abolish",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b03",
     "shot": "committee",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Two years later he was the most powerful member of the Committee of Public",
     "date": 1793,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b04",
     "shot": "committee",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Safety, which ran the country in a permanent state of emergency.",
     "date": 1793,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "blip",
       "w:emergency.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b05",
     "shot": "suspects",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In September 1793 the Law of Suspects allowed people to be arrested not for",
     "date": 1793,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:Suspects",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b06",
     "shot": "suspects",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "what they had done, but for being suspected of opposing the revolution.",
     "date": 1793,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:suspected",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b07",
     "shot": "tribunal",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Revolutionary tribunals followed.",
     "date": 1793,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b08",
     "shot": "tribunal",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In June 1794 a new law stripped many of the accused of the right",
     "date": 1794,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b09",
     "shot": "tribunal",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "to a defence lawyer.",
     "date": 1794,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slide_down",
       2,
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b10",
     "shot": "grim",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "This period is called the Terror, and the numbers are grim:",
     "date": 1794,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b11",
     "shot": "grim",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "around 17,000 official death sentences, and historians estimate tens of thousands more people died",
     "date": 1794,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b12",
     "shot": "grim",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "without trial or in prison.",
     "date": 1794,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b13",
     "shot": "who_died",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "And most of those executed were not aristocrats.",
     "date": 1794,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b14",
     "shot": "who_died",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "They were ordinary people: farmers, workers, shopkeepers.",
     "date": 1794,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b15",
     "shot": "equal_scale",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The guillotine, by the way, was meant to be the humane option,",
     "date": 1792,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b16",
     "shot": "equal_scale",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "a quick death that was the same for rich and poor.",
     "date": 1792,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "creak",
       2,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b17",
     "shot": "dr_guillotin",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Dr Guillotin, whose name it carries, didn't build it,",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b18",
     "shot": "dr_guillotin",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "and he died in his bed in 1814.",
     "date": 1814,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b19",
     "shot": "thermidor",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The end came on 9 Thermidor, 27 July 1794.",
     "date": 1794,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       "w:27",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b20",
     "shot": "turn_on",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Deputies who feared they were next turned on Robespierre.",
     "date": 1794,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "hit",
       "w:turned",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b21",
     "shot": "arrest",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "He was arrested, tried to shoot himself and shattered his jaw,",
     "date": 1794,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b22",
     "shot": "dawn",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "and was guillotined the next day with about twenty of his allies.",
     "date": 1794,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b23",
     "shot": "machine_of_fear",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The man who built the machine of fear was eventually caught in it.",
     "date": 1794,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "machine",
       0,
       0.35
      ],
      [
       "thud",
       85,
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b24",
     "shot": "todo_meanwhilet",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Meanwhile, the revolution had been busy reinventing time itself."
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b25",
     "shot": "sketch_calendar",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "We have replaced the seven-day week with a ten-day week.",
     "date": 1793,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b26",
     "shot": "sketch_calendar",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "Wonderful. And the day off?",
     "date": 1793,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b27",
     "shot": "sketch_calendar",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "One day in ten.",
     "date": 1793,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b28",
     "shot": "sketch_calendar",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "Before, it was one in seven.",
     "date": 1793,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b29",
     "shot": "sketch_calendar",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "Yes, but the new week is more rational.",
     "date": 1793,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b30",
     "shot": "sketch_calendar",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "So I work more.",
     "date": 1793,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b31",
     "shot": "sketch_calendar",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "You work more rationally.",
     "date": 1793,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b32",
     "shot": "sketch_calendar",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "And this month?",
     "date": 1793,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b33",
     "shot": "sketch_calendar",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "Frimaire. It means frosty.",
     "date": 1793,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b34",
     "shot": "sketch_calendar",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "It's raining.",
     "date": 1793,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b35",
     "shot": "sketch_calendar",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "It is frosty in spirit.",
     "date": 1793,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b36",
     "shot": "boxes_tease",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Quick pause.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b37",
     "shot": "boxes_tease",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And stay with me, because everything so far is the part you might have heard before.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b38",
     "shot": "boxes_tease",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In about fifteen minutes we land in this very month,",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:month,",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b39",
     "shot": "boxes_tease",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and I'm going to show you the three ingredients historians say every revolution needs,",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       "w:three",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b40",
     "shot": "boxes_tease",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and exactly how many boxes France ticks today.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b41",
     "shot": "boxes_tease",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The answer isn't the one the headlines give you.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b42",
     "shot": "exhausted",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "But first, France was exhausted, broke, and sick of ideology.",
     "date": 1799,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:exhausted,",
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:broke,",
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:ideology.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b43",
     "shot": "exhausted",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "It wanted order.",
     "date": 1799,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "impact",
       "w:order.",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b44",
     "shot": "corsica",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "And an artillery officer from an island France had bought a year before he",
     "date": 1799,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:island",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s06b45",
     "shot": "corsica",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "was born was about to offer it.",
     "date": 1799,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "riser",
       0,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    }
   ],
   "mood": "sombre"
  }
 ]
}